{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/react/05_Component_생성_파일분리/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"복잡한-html을-한-단어로-치환할-수-있는-component-문법\" style=\"position:relative;\">복잡한 html을 한 단어로 치환할 수 있는 Component 문법<a href=\"#%EB%B3%B5%EC%9E%A1%ED%95%9C-html%EC%9D%84-%ED%95%9C-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B4%EB%A1%9C-%EC%B9%98%ED%99%98%ED%95%A0-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94-component-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"복잡한 html을 한 단어로 치환할 수 있는 component 문법 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>리액트는 긴 HTML을 한 단어로 깔끔하게 치환해서 넣을 수 있는 문법을 제공합니다.<br>\ncomponent라고 합니다.<br>\n이걸 이용하면 함수나 변수를 만들듯이 HTML을 깔끔하게 한 단어로 치환해서 원하는 곳에 넣을 수 있습니다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>function을 이용해서 함수를 하나 만들어주고 return안에 JSX를 작성한다.</li>\n<li>원하는 곳에 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;함수명 /></code>을 넣어준다.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">...</span>생략<span class=\"token operator\">...</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Modal <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\t<span class=\"token comment\">// Component</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">Modal</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div className<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"modal\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>제목<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h4<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>날짜<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n      <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>상세내용<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"component-만들-때-주의-점\" style=\"position:relative;\">Component 만들 때 주의 점<a href=\"#component-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4-%EB%95%8C-%EC%A3%BC%EC%9D%98-%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"component 만들 때 주의 점 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Component 작명 시 첫 글자는 대문자로 한다.</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Modal /></code> 로 써도 되고 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Modal>&lt;/Modal></code>로 써도 된다.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"component-파일-분리\" style=\"position:relative;\">Component 파일 분리<a href=\"#component-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A6%AC\" aria-label=\"component 파일 분리 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-부모-component에-자식-component를-import한다\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 부모 component에 자식 component를 import한다<a href=\"#1-%EB%B6%80%EB%AA%A8-component%