lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-자식-component-파일을-분리해서-생성-후-export-default-한다\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 자식 component 파일을 분리해서 생성 후 export default 한다.<a href=\"#2-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D-component-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC%EC%9D%84-%EB%B6%84%EB%A6%AC%ED%95%B4%EC%84%9C-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1-%ED%9B%84-export-default-%ED%95%9C%EB%8B%A4\" aria-label=\"2 자식 component 파일을 분리해서 생성 후 export default 한다 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">Modal</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>나는 모달 컴포넌트<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> Modal<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 여러개 export 가능</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> b <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EB%B3%B5%EC%9E%A1%ED%95%9C-html%EC%9D%84-%ED%95%9C-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B4%EB%A1%9C-%EC%B9%98%ED%99%98%ED%95%A0-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8A%94-component-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95\">복잡한 html을 한 단어로 치환할 수 있는 Component 문법</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#component-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4-%EB%95%8C-%EC%A3%BC%EC%9D%98-%EC%A0%90\">Component 만들 때 주의 점</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#component-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EB%B6%84%EB%A6%AC\">Component 파일 분리</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#1-%EB%B6%80%EB%AA%A8-component%EC%97%90-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D-component%EB%A5%BC-import%ED%95%9C%EB%8B%A4\">1. 부모 component에 자식 component를 import한다</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#2-%EC%9E%90%EC%8B%9D-component-%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC%EC%9D%84-%EB%B6%84%EB%A6%AC%ED%95%B4%EC%84%9C-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1-%ED%9B%84-export-default-%ED%95%9C%EB%8B%A4\">2. 자식 component 파일을 분리해서 생성 후 export default 한다.</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Sep 30, 2026